{
  "Combat.Arian.Talisman.Dispel.Name": "Arian's Talisman - Dispel",
  "Combat.Arian.Talisman.Dispel.Description": "Remove most magical effects, positive or negative, from both you and the targeted enemy.",
  "Combat.Arian.Talisman.Dispel.Intro": "You gather energy in your Talisman and unleash the spell contained within. An orange light appears and flashes briefly before vanishing.\\n",
  "Combat.Arian.Talisman.Dispel.ChargeWeapon": "\\nYour weapon no longer glows as your spell is dispelled.",
  "Combat.Arian.Talisman.Dispel.Leeching": "[b:The incantation surrounding your [weapon] fades away.]\\n",
  "Combat.Arian.Talisman.Dispel.TFInflame": "\\nThe fire surrounding you and your weapon fizzles out.",
  "Combat.Arian.Talisman.Dispel.TFPlate": "\\nYour earthen armor crumbles and falls to the ground.",
  "Combat.Arian.Talisman.Dispel.TFMoltenPlate": "\\nYou're no longer coated in molten rock.",
  "Combat.Arian.Talisman.Dispel.ParasiteQueen": "\\nThe parasites are no longer boosting your energy.",
  "Combat.Arian.Talisman.Dispel.NephilaQueen": "\\nThe parasites are no longer boosting your energy.",
  "Combat.Arian.Talisman.Dispel.TrueWhispered": "\\nYour mind is now free of the horrible whispering.",
  "Combat.Arian.Talisman.Dispel.Marked": "\\nYou feel the Courtier's hex wear off - you're no longer cursed!",
  "Combat.Arian.Talisman.Dispel.Nothingness": "\\nThe talisman successfully removes the creature's spell, restoring your existence!",
  "Combat.Arian.Talisman.Dispel.Might": "\\nYou feel a bit weaker as your strength-enhancing spell wears off.",
  "Combat.Arian.Talisman.Dispel.EnemyChargeWeapon": "\\nThe glow around [themonster]'s weapon fades completely.",
  "Combat.Arian.Talisman.Dispel.GolemShield": "\\nThe golem's shimmering shield dissipates - he can be attacked again!",
